<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Timothy niina</book>
  <para style="h">Timothy niina</para>
  <para style="toc1">Timothy niina</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timothy niina</para>
  <para style="mt">Timothy niina</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Christ Jesus taw kikop a, ih nei hong kikamciam nuntakna a thangsak tu in Pathian ii deina taw a kisawl Christ Jesus sawltakpa Paul in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka it ka tapa Timothy tungah lai kong thaak hi: Ih Pa Pathian le ih Topa Christ Jesus in thuthiamna, hesuakna le thinnopna hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite ii sep bangin thinsung thiangtho taw a na ka sepsak Pathian tungah lungdam ka ko hi. Sun taw zan taw ka thungetna sungah nang kong phawk a, ama tungah lungdam ka ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thituite ka phawk a, tua ahikom, ka lungdamna a kicin natu in, nang kong mu nuam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na pi Lois le na nu Eunice te zongh ii a nei bang a na nei thintak upna sia ka phawk hi. Nang zongh tuabang ma in nei tu ni hi ci in kong muang tatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi thu hu in, na tungah khut kong ngak ciang Pathian hong piak tel sia na nuntaksak natu in kong phawksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian hong piak Thaa in eite hong lauthauhsak bua hi; tua hizaw ngawlin, a Thaa in vaangletna, itna le eima le eima ki uk zawkna taw hong kidimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Topa atu tetti panna ah maizum heak in, Christ atu in thongtaakpa kei atu zonghin maizum heak in. Tua hi zaw ngawlin Pathian nasep natu thahatna hong piak bangin, Lungdamna Thupha atu thuakna sungah na kihel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in ama aituam mihingte ih sua natu in eite hong hun a, hong sam hi; eite ii sepnate hang hi ngawlin, ama tupna le thuthiamna hang ahi hi. Hun kipat ma in ama in Christ Jesus tungtawnin hi thuthiamna hong pia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahihang tu in ih Hunpa Christ Jesus hong paina tungtawnin tua thu hong kilak hi. Ama in thina vaangletna bosak zo a, tuabangin lungdamna thu tungtawnin thimawk nuntakna hong lak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha a thangsak tu le a hil tu in, Pathian in sawltak panmun kei hong suanh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaciangin hi thu hu in hite ka thuak hi. Ahihang thinmuanna taw ka kidim nginge lai hi, banghang ziam cile ka uppa ka he a, ama in kei hong muang a hong aapsa teng sia tua Ni dong ama in hong kepcingsak thei tu ci in ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thumaan kammal kong hilte na kholet in a, na zui tu etteena in nei in, tuaciangin Christ Jesus taw kikopna sungah, eite aa ahi upna le ki itna sungah na kip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ih sungah hong teang Thaa Thiangtho vaangletna tungtawnin, nang tungah, hong kimuang a hong ki aap naphate keamcing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Phygelus le Hermogenes kihelin, Asia ngammi theampo ii kei hong taisat siat sia na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Onesiphorus innkuan sungah hesuakna tungsak tahen, banghang ziam cile tamvei ma ka thin hong nuamsak hi. Thonginn sungah ka om sia, ama in hong maizumpui ngawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rome khua a thet po ciangin hong mu dawdong hong zong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua Ni ciangin Topa in ama tungah hesuakna pia tahen. Ephesus khua ah zongh, kei atu in ama in bangza in hong seam ci sia na heak mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tapa awng, nang na hi le, Jesus Christ taw ih kikopna tungtawnin ih nga thuthiamna hangin thahat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tetti tam mamate ii mai ah ka thansak hilnate la in, ngualdang a hil sawn thei tu a muanhuaite tungah aap in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesus Christ ii a thumaan a ngalkappa bangin ngimna thuak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a seam lai ngalkap khat in, a mangpa diksak tu uuk a, khua mi thawthongte ii vai sungah kihel ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tai kidemna sungah a tai khat in ngeina a kikoite a zui buale tel saang thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lothopa khat nasep haksa a seam sia in, anlaak ciangin ama ii tel tu in an a tung masabel sia nga tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kong son teng sia na ngaisusun in, banghang ziam cile Topa in a vekpi in hong tel theisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha sungah a kihil, keima thuhilna ahi, thina pan a kitho kiksak David suan ahi Jesus Christ sia na phawk ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungdamna Thupha thuhilna in ka nei hu in, ka thuak a, mihing a maw a khialte bangin thikkol taw ngawngawnin hong kikhit hi. Ahihang Pathian kammal sia thikkhau kibul ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesus Christ tungtawn a hong pai ngupna le tawntung minthanna sia Pathian tealsa mite zongh in a nga thei natu in, na theampo ka thuak kenkon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi thu sia thumaan hi: “Ama taw ih thi khawm zo ahile, ama taw ma in ih nungta khawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuakna ih zom to suak le ama taw ih maangkhawm tu hi. Ama ih nial le, ama zongh in hong nial tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ih thumaan bua zonghin, ama sia hong thumaan top hi, banghang ziam cile ama le ama kitheam thei ngawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihingte tungah hi thu phawksak in a, tuaciang kam kinialin a kihau ngawl natu in, Pathian mai ah a ciliap huai kidop natu in hilkhol in. Hite in bangma phat tuamna hong pia ngawl a, a zate atu in siatna piangsak bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian muna ah a kicing kikipsakna na nga natu in a phabelin naseam in a, nasep tungtaang ah a maizum natu a om ngawl naseampa bang hi in, Pathian thumaan thute a maan tak a hil theipa na hi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kiihuai le a mawmawthuai kam kikupnate pan kikeam in, tuate in mihingte Pathian kung panin kikhualasak bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabang kihilnate in ih sa hong neaksak meima balhte bang ahi hi. Tuabang a hil pasal niite sia Hymenaeus le Philetus ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in thumaan lampi nusia in, ih thaw kikna sia hong piang zo hi ci in a hilna uh taw mihing pawlkhatte upna lalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahitazong Pathian ii a phaa sa, a kip tawdap sia kingawksak thei ngawl hi; tuaciang tua tungah hi kammalte ki at hi. “Topa in ama ii neisate he hi,” tuaciang “A kuama po Topa ii neisa ka hi a cite in ngamtat khialna pial tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Inn lian khat ii sungah kuang le keau a namcin in om hi: pawlkhat sia ngunn le khamh taw kivawt a, a dangte sia thing le tungman taw kivawt hi, pawlkhatte sia hun thupi sungah zak tu hi a, a dangte sia hun thawthong sungah zak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khat po in a siate theampo panin, a kithiangsak le ama sia tupna theampo ah kizangh tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama sia a Topa atu in a kipia a taktaipa hi a, na pha sep natu sung theampo ah a kizangh tu in kinging khol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khangno lungngulnate pialin, tuaciangin thumaan thutang, upna, ki itna, thinnopna sia, thinsung thiangtho taw Topa tungah huna ngen a, a aute taw nga khawm tu in na hanciam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang mawmawthuai le telmeal om ngawl kam kinialnate na pial in, tuate sia kihauna taw tawp ahi sia na heak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa ii naseampa in ngual taw kihau ngawl tu hi. Ama in mihing theampo tung a thinneam tu a, a thin uai sya pha hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama a langpante a puuaphat kik ciangin, thu khualna zangh tu hi. Banghang ziam cile Pathian in amate tungah kisii kikna pia in thumaan thutak a heak natu zongh hi thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuasia zawkciangin amate sia khuaphawk tu a, ama thu nisak nuamin a manpa Doaimangpa thaang sung panin amate suakta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni tawpkhak hun ciangin hun haksa hong om tu hi, ci in na ciamtee in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihingte sia duhop, kaangsung he, kisathei, kiphasak tu hi; amate in ngual langin, nu le pa thu ni ngawlin, lungdamna he ngawl, biakna nei ngawlin hong om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate sia dikna nei ngawl, hesuakna sel, ngual min siasak, ngoltol, kiitakhuai, a phate ensan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />muan thamman ngawl, lopthop, tuaciangin kisak theina taw kidim tu uh hi. Pathian sangin pumpi nopsakna deizaw tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in ih biakna sia a pua zuunna in nei tu a, ahihang a vaangletna tatak sia nial tu uh hi. Tuabang mihingte kung pan kiheam ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate sung pan pawlkhat sia ngual inn sungah tumin mawna vanhngit a pua, deina ukna tuatuam a nei numei thaneamte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />sin nuam he nuam tawntung leei ahihang thumaan thutak a tel zo ngawl numeite, amate ii upna sangah zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jannes le Jambres in Moses a langpan uh bangma in — hi mihingte in thumaan thutak langpan uh hi. Amate sia a khua ngaisutna uh naseam ngawl a upna sangah a lel ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang amate sia mainawt ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile mihing theampo in amate mawmawtna hong mu tu a, Jannes le Jambres te ii thuak bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahizong nangma in ka hilna hong zui a ka ngamtatna hong zui in, nuntakna sungah ka tupna nong zui hi. Ka upna, ka thinsauna, ka itna, ka thuak zawkna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hong kivawtsiatna le ka thuak thute theampo nong mu zo hi. Antioch, Iconium le Lystra ah vawtsiatna nasia mama ka thuak sate theampo na he zo hi. Ahihang, Topa in tuate theampo pan hong suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kuama po Jesus Christ taw kipawlin, Pathian dei bang nuntakna a nungta nuamte sia kivawtsia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang mihing ngilote le a kimealsealte in, phat ngawlna pan, phat ngawl seseam na ah zuan tu uh a, ngual theamin amate le amate dongin theam thuak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang nang na hile hong kihil sa, kho takin na upna thumaan thutakte na zomto suak in. Na Syate sia a kuate ziam ci in na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jesus Christ ih upna tungtawnin ngupna thu sungah hong lampui ciimna hong pia thei Lai Thiangtho sia na no ciang a, na heaksa thu ahi hunlam ciamtee ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laithiangtho sia a vekpi in Pathian hu mop ahi hi. Thumaan thutak hil natu, teih natu, khialna pua natu, a maan a nuntakna tu in hil natu sung theampo ah manpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ahikom, Pathian na a seamte in naphate theampo a vawt natu in, kicinna a cingin a nei thei natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian mai le Kumpi a hong maang tu in hong pai tu, a thite le a nungtate tungah thukhen tu, Jesus Christ mai ah, ciliap huai takin kong sawl nopna panin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ngupna thu sia thuhilna in na nei in, (a hun a lem zong, a lem bua zong) upsak natu, teih natu, hanthot natu in thinsauna taw na thansak natu na vawt hamtang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingte in upna thubul maante hong za nuam nawn buatu a, amate deina uh zui in, bilthak liang a, a zaak nop uh thute a son tu syate tam vaial hong khoptua tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in thumaan thute ngaina pan puapial in, phuatawm thute hong ngai nuamzaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang nangma le nangma sia hunte theampo sungah na ki uk in; ngimnate na thuak kenkon in, Lungdamna Thupha thuhilpa nasepte naseam in a, Pathian naseampa bangin nasep tu theampo na seam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei ka hile sangaw biakpiak bangin hong kivawt tu hun, hong theng zo hi; kei atu in nuntakna ka nusiat tu hun hong theng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tai kidemna ah ka hi thei tawpin ka hi zo a, ka tai tu tan ka tai zo hi, upna ka keamcing zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu in thumaan thutang thukhenpa, Topa in tua Ni ciangin kei hong piak tu, Pathian mai ah thutang suana zawna thaman in kei hong ngak nginge hi. Kei bek hong pia tu hi ngawl a, ama hong pai kik tu itna taw a ngakte theampo zongh pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei kungah hai ngawlin nong pai natu in, hong hanciam ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Demas in hi leitung it zaw a, kei hong taisan zo hi. Thessalonica hong zot san hi. Crescens sia Galatia zuan hi, tuaciang Titus sia Dalmatia zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luke bek kei taw om lai hi. Mark samin hi sungah hong paipui ta'n, banghang ziam cile ama in ka nasep hong hu thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephesus ah Tychicus ka paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nong pai ciang Troas khua Carpus kungah ka nusiat ka laktong puasilh hong paipui ta'n; laibute zongh hong keng ta'n, savun taw a kivawt sia a tuanin ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thik seakpa Alexander in hong nawngkaisak mama hi. Topa in ama ii sepna sa tung pan thaman pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang mama zongh ama tungtaang ah na kidawm in, banghang ziam cile ama in ih ngupna thuhilnate nasia takin hong langpan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima le keima ka kihuuk phitbel lai in, kuama in kei hong dinpui ngawl a hong taisan siat uh hi. Pathian in amate tungah na siik heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahitazong Topa sia kei kungah hong om a, thahatna hong pia hi. Tuasia ciangin Gentile te theampo ii a zaak tu in ngupna thu a cing in ka thangsak thei hi; tuaciang kei sia thidaan panin hong suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in kei sia siatna theampo panin, hong suatak tu a, ama Vantung Ngam sungah muanhuai takin hong lato tu hi. Ama tungah vaangletna a tawntung le a tawntungin om tahen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Priscilla, Aquila le Onesiphorus te innkuan tungah paupuina kong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Erastus sia Corinth ah taam hi. Trophimus sia a ciina ahikom Miletus ah ka nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phalbi ma in nong pai natu hong hanciam tavun. Eubulus, Pudens, Linus le Claudia te in paupuina hong thaak hi. Tuasia bangma in Tapidaw suapui dangte zongh in hong thaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa sia nangma ii thaa taw hong om tahen. Pathian ii thuthiamna sia note theampo taw hong om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
